  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "City page: 54 lots, homes to come in later applications. The city log describes 39 market-rate tract homes, 14 custom homes and a clubhouse on the 54 lots, and gives the zoning file as Z 22-02.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001419",
        "SRC-001420"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Initial Study: Phase 1 would build 40 homes on the eastern half on lots of about 6,660 to 12,070 sq ft; Phase 2 would build 14 homes on the western half (11 northwest, 3 southwest) on lots of about 8,990 to 61,050 sq ft. The analysis assumes about 3,500 sq ft eastern homes, 5,000 sq ft western homes and an 8,000 sq ft clubhouse.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003462"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The site is rezoned to RH (Residential Hillside). The creek and pond in the center of the site are preserved. CEQAnet SCH 2024080035 lists the City of Gilroy approval on February 24, 2025.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001419",
        "SRC-003463"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City and state records name Susan Wang as applicant; the city project log names Ren Jizhong as applicant.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003462",
        "SRC-003463",
        "SRC-001420"
      ]
    }
